, "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "The City rents offices, clinics, shelters and storage from private owners.", "t0": 14.98, "t1": 19.06, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "City as tenant", "kicker": "Offices, clinics, shelters, storage", "sub": "each lease approved by a Board file"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.42, 0.75, 1.36, 1.93, 2.42, 2.55, 3.01, 3.19, 3.59]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "The Assessor’s roll records when each building changes hands.", "t0": 19.18, "t1": 22.2, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "City as tenant", "kicker": "Offices, clinics, shelters, storage", "sub": "each lease approved by a Board file"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.62, 0.89, 1.27, 1.47, 1.71, 2.06, 2.5]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "count", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "amount", "oneLine"], "text": "14 buildings the City rents show a sale date after the lease file, or a large re-set value.", "t0": 22.42, "t1": 27.85, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "count", "value": "14", "label": "buildings the City rents: a sale date after the lease file, or a large value re-set"}, "emph": ["14 buildings"], "wt": [0.0, 0.5, 0.93, 1.03, 1.31, 1.66, 1.9, 1.97, 2.27, 2.56, 2.81, 2.91, 3.17, 3.84, 4.03, 4.11, 4.47, 4.92]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[4]"], "text": "One more, 888 Post Street, is left out: that sale date is the City’s own purchase.", "t0": 27.97, "t1": 33.42, "shot": "b3p", "visual": {"type": "doc", "kicker": "Deed 2021131274 · File 210772", "text": "888 Post Street is not counted: the sale date of 12 August 2021 on its roll is the City’s own purchase", "mark": "the City’s own purchase"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.61, 0.86, 1.34, 1.6, 1.9, 2.05, 2.32, 3.09, 3.37, 3.68, 3.98, 4.12, 4.23, 4.61, 4.85]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "752 Vallejo Street:", "t0": 33.54, "t1": 35.82, "shot": "b4a", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "752 Vallejo Street", "kicker": "A building the City rents"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 1.01, 1.49]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "sources[14]", "suspicious[3]", "established[8]"], "text": "The March 2026 date marks a resale by the bank.", "t0": 35.82, "t1": 38.84, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "752 Vallejo Street", "sub": "Foreclosure in August 2025 · bank resale in March 2026"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.2, 0.5, 0.8, 1.39, 1.69, 1.94, 2.02, 2.43, 2.59, 2.69]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "333 Valencia: 2,058 days.", "t0": 38.96, "t1": 42.81, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Days from lease file to sale date", "rows": [["2000 Oakdale Avenue", "3,559"], ["760 Harrison Street", "3,289"], ["333 Valencia Street", "2,058"], ["3801 Third Street", "1,443"], ["752 Vallejo Street", "1,421"], ["141 Industrial Street", "701"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.6, 1.16, 2.2, 2.45, 2.84, 3.37]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what"], "text": "141 Industrial: just 701.", "t0": 42.93, "t1": 45.64, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Days from lease file to sale date", "rows": [["2000 Oakdale Avenue", "3,559"], ["760 Harrison Street", "3,289"], ["333 Valencia Street", "2,058"], ["3801 Third Street", "1,443"], ["752 Vallejo Street", "1,421"], ["141 Industrial Street", "701"]]}, "emph": ["701"], "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.51, 0.96, 1.54, 1.72, 2.01, 2.36]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[6]"], "text": "At 333 Valencia, the City’s rent went to a new company name from April 2026.", "t0": 45.76, "t1": 51.42, "shot": "b4c", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "x24b", "kicker": "Controller · vendor payments · Public Health", "text": "333 Valencia Owner LLC: rows to January 2026. 333 Valencia Building JV LLC: from April 2026", "mark": "333 Valencia Building JV LLC"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.41, 0.69, 1.23, 1.96, 2.14, 2.52, 2.79, 3.01, 3.12, 3.19, 3.36, 3.75, 3.99, 4.24, 4.58, 4.88]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[7]", "timeline[10]"], "text": "But the Recorder shows a deed in lieu of foreclosure there, not a sale for a price.", "t0": 51.54, "t1": 55.45, "shot": "b4d", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "c6v1", "kicker": "Recorder’s index · 3 February 2026", "text": "333 Valencia Owner LLC conveyed the building to 333 Valencia Building JV LLC by a deed in lieu of foreclosure", "mark": "deed in lieu of foreclosure"}, "emph": ["deed in lieu of foreclosure"], "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.21, 0.62, 0.88, 0.96, 1.23, 1.33, 1.48, 1.56, 2.15, 2.6, 2.81, 2.88, 3.18, 3.34, 3.4]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "sources[14]"], "text": "At 141 Industrial Street, the lender also took title before the resale.", "t0": 55.57, "t1": 59.49, "shot": "r14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "141 Industrial Street", "sub": "Trustee’s deed in November 2025"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.4, 0.88, 1.37, 1.7, 1.82, 2.15, 2.46, 2.66, 2.97, 3.28, 3.38]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["established[3]", "oneLine", "notEstablished[4]"], "text": "Not every date is a whole sale: 5 brought a full re-set of value, 3 none.", "t0": 59.61, "t1": 64.03, "shot": "b5r", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "What came after each sale date", "rows": [["full re-set of value", "5"], ["part re-set", "1"], ["no new value", "3"], ["dated 2026, too late for the roll", "4"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.48, 0.74, 0.86, 0.92, 1.14, 1.74, 2.1, 2.32, 2.38, 2.67, 3.04, 3.12, 3.72, 4.07]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why"], "text": "A sale under a long City lease turns the lease into an asset for the next owner.", "t0": 64.15, "t1": 68.35, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "A sale under a long City lease turns the lease into an asset for the next owner."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.58, 0.8, 0.87, 1.19, 1.48, 1.79, 2.14, 2.24, 2.52, 2.74, 2.86, 3.26, 3.38, 3.46, 3.78]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why"], "text": "Did the City know? And did the rent or terms change after?", "t0": 68.47, "t1": 71.53, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "A sale under a long City lease turns the lease into an asset for the next owner."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.27, 0.52, 1.05, 1.23, 1.37, 1.47, 1.71, 1.86, 2.24, 2.59]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "suspicious[1].what"], "text": "Then 1380 Howard Street.", "t0": 71.75, "t1": 73.48, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "kicker": "File 171178", "text": "1380 Howard Street: rent $3,417,862 a year", "mark": "$3,417,862"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.64, 0.93, 1.28]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "suspicious[1].what"], "text": "The City rents it for 3,417,862 dollars a year.", "t0": 73.6, "t1": 76.6, "shot": "b7c", "visual": {"type": "doc", "kicker": "File 171178", "text": "1380 Howard Street: rent $3,417,862 a year", "mark": "$3,417,862"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.39, 0.66, 0.78, 0.9, 1.14, 1.38, 1.66, 1.91, 2.22, 2.57, 2.65]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "links[3]"], "text": "On the 2025-26 roll,", "t0": 76.72, "t1": 78.7, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["2025-26 roll", "$5,397,142"], "b": ["2026-27 roll", "$28,298,880"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.24, 0.5, 1.03, 1.11, 1.66]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "links[3]"], "text": "its value was 5,397,142 dollars.", "t0": 78.7, "t1": 81.42, "shot": "b8c", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["2025-26 roll", "$5,397,142"], "b": ["2026-27 roll", "$28,298,880"]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.25, 0.59, 0.71, 0.97, 1.26, 1.54, 1.79, 2.13]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "links[3]"], "text": "On the 2026-27 roll: 28,298,880.", "t0": 81.54, "t1": 85.79, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["2025-26 roll", "$5,397,142"], "b": ["2026-27 roll", "$28,298,880"]}, "emph": ["28,298,880"], "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.24, 0.63, 1.26, 1.38, 2.02, 2.41, 2.7, 3.24, 3.5, 3.76]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "sources[14]"], "text": "The Recorder indexed an affidavit of death on this property.", "t0": 86.31, "t1": 89.15, "shot": "r23", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "rec25", "kicker": "1380 Howard Street", "text": "Affidavit of death · 22 October 2024", "mark": "22 October 2024"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.56, 0.98, 1.12, 1.63, 1.73, 2.01, 2.13, 2.28]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "sources[14]"], "text": "A change of ownership after a death could explain the reassessment.", "t0": 89.27, "t1": 92.39, "shot": "r24", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "building", "label": "1380 Howard Street", "sub": "No sale date on either roll"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.45, 0.56, 1.04, 1.29, 1.36, 1.64, 1.8, 2.18, 2.28]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "suspicious[2].what"], "text": "9 sites the City rents carry an exemption:", "t0": 92.61, "t1": 95.52, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$353,304,129", "label": "exempt value on the 2026-27 roll", "sub": "9 rented sites"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.37, 0.73, 0.84, 1.12, 1.47, 1.77, 1.85]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "suspicious[2].what"], "text": "353,304,129 dollars of exempt value.", "t0": 95.52, "t1": 99.27, "shot": "b10c", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$353,304,129", "label": "exempt value on the 2026-27 roll", "sub": "9 rented sites"}, "emph": ["353,304,129"], "wt": [0.04, 0.34, 0.61, 0.96, 1.54, 1.81, 2.08, 2.41, 2.78, 2.87, 3.25]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "The largest: 845 Jackson Street,", "t0": 99.39, "t1": 102.43, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "845 Jackson Street", "kicker": "The largest", "sub": "welfare exemption, $232,196,298"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.95, 1.21, 1.77, 2.26]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what"], "text": "a welfare exemption of 232,196,298 dollars.", "t0": 102.43, "t1": 106.26, "shot": "b11x", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$232,196,298", "label": "welfare exemption", "sub": "845 Jackson Street"}, "emph": ["232,196,298"], "wt": [0.04, 0.2, 0.59, 1.06, 1.15, 1.38, 1.58, 1.89, 2.4, 2.67, 2.89, 3.25]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why"], "text": "An exemption applies when the property is used for the exempt purpose.", "t0": 106.38, "t1": 109.62, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "An exemption applies when the property is used for the exempt purpose."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.63, 1.11, 1.21, 1.29, 1.67, 1.83, 2.05, 2.17, 2.28, 2.66]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why"], "text": "City rent for its own offices is a use the claim must account for.", "t0": 109.74, "t1": 113.19, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "An exemption applies when the property is used for the exempt purpose."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.38, 0.6, 0.72, 0.89, 1.1, 1.6, 1.75, 1.87, 2.11, 2.21, 2.49, 2.72, 3.1]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[4]", "innocent[0]"], "text": "The rolls give no owner and no price.", "t0": 113.41, "t1": 115.43, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Sale prices", "Whether the terms of each lease changed"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.44, 0.66, 0.86, 1.17, 1.33, 1.51]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[4]", "innocent[0]"], "text": "A sale date can also mean a refinancing, or a transfer between related companies.", "t0": 115.55, "t1": 119.66, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Sale prices", "Whether the terms of each lease changed"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.43, 0.66, 0.82, 1.07, 1.24, 1.31, 2.09, 2.23, 2.29, 2.77, 3.07, 3.46]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[1]"], "text": "What would settle it? The deeds, and the Real Estate Division’s lease files.", "t0": 119.78, "t1": 123.88, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "The deed and transfer-tax declaration for each sale"}, {"who": "", "what": "Whether each lease was assigned or renegotiated, and at what rent"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.28, 0.6, 1.34, 1.52, 2.03, 2.22, 2.3, 2.49, 2.73, 3.21, 3.49]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status", "defense[0]"], "text": "No authority has made a finding, and no landlord is accused.", "t0": 124.0, "t1": 127.14, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.66, 0.78, 0.92, 0.99, 1.51, 1.72, 1.9, 2.38, 2.52]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 127.26, "t1": 129.26, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.4, 0.5, 0.56, 1.0, 1.18, 1.27]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "3,559 days", "lead1": "What the deeds show", "lead2": "Lead 2 · 1380 Howard", "lead3": "Lead 3 · exempt", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "map", "hook": "timeline"}